## HP docking station research 

# Overview:
 This document provides research on HP docking stations, which includes their features, connectivity, and laptop compatibility.
The purpose of this research is to help non-technical users understand how HP docking station models have advanced over time.
This is done by showing how their features affect laptop compatibility and connectivity. 

HP docking station 

1. HP Native docking station

HP USB-C docking stations have supported display connections, peripherals, Ethernet cable ports, and power delivery through 
a USB-C connection.

Examples: 

-HP USB-C Dock G5: This dock provides USB-A, USB-C, DisplayPort, HDMI, and Ethernet connections.

-HP Elite USB-C Docking Station: This docking station integrates display outputs. 
